badja/1/16","tekst":"Want zoals u gedronken hebt op de berg Van mijn heiligheid, zo zullen al de heidenen steeds drinken; ja, zij zullen drinken en opslokken, en zullen zijn als of zij er niet geweest waren.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":11,"eind":12},{"woord":"hebt","start":23,"eind":27},{"woord":"de","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"Van","start":39,"eind":42},{"woord":"mijn","start":43,"eind":47},{"woord":"zo","start":60,"eind":62},{"woord":"zullen","start":63,"eind":69},{"woord":"de","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"ja","start":101,"eind":103},{"woord":"zij","start":105,"eind":108},{"woord":"zullen","start":109,"eind":115},{"woord":"en","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"en","start":138,"eind":140},{"woord":"zullen","start":141,"eind":147},{"woord":"als","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"of","start":157,"eind":159},{"woord":"zij","start":160,"eind":163},{"woord":"er","start":164,"eind":166},{"woord":"waren","start":180,"eind":185}]},{"ref":"obadja/1/17","tekst":"Maar op de berg van Sion zal ontkoming zijn, en hij zal een heiligheid zijn; en die van het huis van Jakob zullen hun erfgoederen erfelijk bezitten.","woorden":[{"woord":"Maar","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"op","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"de","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"van","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"zal","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"en","start":45,"eind":47},{"woord":"hij","start":48,"eind":51},{"woord":"zal","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"een","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"en","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"die","start":80,"eind":83},{"woord":"van","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"het","start":88,"eind":91},{"woord":"van","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"zullen","start":107,"eind":113},{"woord":"hun","start":114,"eind":117},{"woord":"erfelijk","start":130,"eind":138}]},{"ref":"obadja/1/18","tekst":"En Jakobs huis zal een vuur zijn, en Jozefs huis een vlam, en Ezau's huis tot een stoppel; en zij zullen tegen hen ontbranden, en zullen ze verteren, zodat Ezau's huis geen overgeblevene zal 